PDC(1)                         ZOAU Command Syntax                        PDC(1)

NAME

	pdc - Print the currently active SMS data classes.

SYNOPSIS

	pdc [-dhv] [-Q <tmphlq>]

	-d
		Run in debug mode.

	-h
		Print this syntax message.

	-Q <tmphlq>
		Use an alternative high-level qualifier (HLQ) for the temporary dataset
		name. This will override the TMPHLQ environment variable as well.

	-v
		Run in verbose mode.

EXIT VALUES

	0
		Success.

	4
		Invalid syntax.

	Other
		Command failed, see error message for details.

ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES

	TMPDIR
		Overrides the current directory used for temporary files.

	TMPHLQ
		Overrides the current high-level qualifier for the temporary
		dataset names.

	ISMF_HLQ
		Overrides the current high-level qualifier used to reference the ISMF
		libraries.

	ISPF_HLQ
		Overrides the current high-level qualifier used to reference the ISPF
		libraries.
